This folder holds the Docker secrets. Its *.txt files are git-ignored and are
generated by `make setup`:

  db_root_password.txt   MariaDB root password
  db_password.txt        MariaDB password of ${MYSQL_USER}
  ftp_password.txt       password of the FTP user (bonus)
  credentials.txt        WordPress passwords, as KEY=VALUE lines:
                           WP_ADMIN_PASSWORD=...
                           WP_USER_PASSWORD=...

Never commit these files.
